	(text "POWER – one protected 18650 → 5.1 V for the Pi 3 A+ and 3.3 V for the radio (DRAFT – for ET review)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "21148ef6-3736-520f-b51d-a0e383ec5c01")
	)
	(text "1  BATTERY & REVERSE PROTECTION"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ee65e8bc-bb64-5717-ba8b-4c0082f55110")
	)
	(text "Cells: protected 18650 (PCM inside) in an MPD BH-18650-PC\nholder on the box floor (off-board), lead to J20 (JST-VH, 10 A).\nJ21 = second cell in parallel (DNP; only matched cells).\nQ1: the body diode conducts for a correct cell, then VGS = -VBAT\nturns it on; a reversed cell is blocked. D3: ESD/hot-plug clamp.\nDo not plug USB with a reversed cell (the charger, current-limited,\nwould bias Q1 partly on)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 91.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "aef1e3ba-5628-566d-b419-ab1c973ae911")
	)
	(text "2  CHARGER & USB-C (charge-only, 452 mA; charges with the switch OFF)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "82d9d7dd-1461-5f98-9258-d348c1089659")
	)
	(text "CC1/CC2 5.1 k = sink (default USB 5 V). RPROG 2.21 k → 452 mA\n(1000 V / RPROG). VC of the SMF5.0A (9.2 V) > MCP73831 VDD abs. max\n7 V: ESD only, not a guard against a faulty charger. No power path:\nthe charger feeds VBAT, upstream of the power switch."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 104.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d38366bc-2a48-5f9e-a5c9-c5b5f0fe88c3")
	)
	(text "STAT pushes to VDD (5 V): never straight to a GPIO.\nCharging: STAT low → D4 on, Q3 off → CHG_STAT = 1.\nComplete: STAT high → Q3 on → CHG_STAT = 0.  No USB: STAT Hi-Z,\nR6 holds Q3 off → CHG_STAT = 1. (USB with no cell / shutdown: Hi-Z,\nR5-D4-R6 bias Q3 on → reads 0 and D4 glows faintly.)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 218.44 104.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "09eb512e-3986-5ad8-a405-b303e744de2c")
	)
	(text "3  POWER SWITCH (P-FET, panel toggle on J22)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 325.12 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "491cda6e-beaa-519e-85da-78eef7b36bc1")
	)
	(text "Toggle (E-Switch 100SP1T1B1M1QEH, off-board), closed = ON:\npulls PWR_G low through R9 → Q2 on. Open: R8 holds Q2 off\nand its body diode blocks VBAT → VBAT_SW. The toggle carries\n~40 µA only. ESD on PWR_SW_J: U12 pin 4."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 325.12 91.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1b716f14-57e5-5c40-8144-65d569ca1a11")
	)
	(text "4  5.1 V BOOST (TPS61022, 1 MHz, auto-PFM)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7a6b8ac6-6fc8-5ec2-94a0-fdf483c89f39")
	)
	(text "VOUT = 0.600 V x (1 + 750k/100k) = 5.10 V (PFM 5.15 V; OVP 5.5 V min).\nL1 744316100 is in TI's Table 8-2; peak ~5.7 A at 3.0 V in / 2.5 A out.\nC3 100 pF: feed-forward zero 1/(2π·750k·100p) = 2.1 kHz (§8.2.2.4, COUT_eff\n> 40 µF). EN = VBAT_SW: on with the switch. MODE = GND: auto PFM (light-load\nefficiency, no reverse inductor current). C5 bulk: the cell sits on a lead\n(§8.2.2.5). Tight SW loop, VIN/VOUT caps at the pins; far corner from the SP4."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "92a3b46f-1ab8-52ad-a331-e7829a97831a")
	)
	(text "5  BACK-POWER IDEAL DIODE (Pi 3B circuit) & 5V_PI AT THE HEADER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220.98 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6d59fae7-db5b-5669-9137-4736b07c269f")
	)
	(text "U3A, diode-connected with its emitter on 5V_BOOST, sets ~0.45 mA through R12; U3B mirrors it\nagainst 5V_PI. Forward (5V_BOOST above 5V_PI by more than ~40 mV): U3B starves, R13 pulls ZVD_G\nlow → Q4 on (≈ 0.15 V at 2.5 A). Back-power (micro-USB on the Pi, or the boost off): 5V_PI >\n5V_BOOST, U3B saturates, ZVD_G ≈ 5V_PI → Q4 off, and its body diode (D → S) is reverse biased.\nPi 3B values: 10 k on the mirror base (R12), 47 k on the gate (R13). The Pi 3 A+ has no such\ncircuit and header pins 2/4 bypass its polyfuse. C9/C10/D2 at header pins 2/4.\nQ4: AO3401A (or DMG2305UX as in the Pi). U3: one BC857BS (units A and B)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220.98 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "16ecbb2e-8b1b-53f3-a5f0-5d56cb6abaef")
	)
	(text "6  RADIO SUPPLY: TLV75533 LDO (fitted) | TPS63001 buck-boost option (all DNP)"
