	)
	(text "LDO: ≈ 65 mV dropout at 150 mA; COUT 1–200 µF (C12 + the 110 µF at the SP4, radio sheet).\nFit exactly ONE of R14 (LDO, default) / R16 (buck-boost). Buck-boost only if T0 shows > 2 dB less\noutput at a 3.0 V cell: FB = VOUT (fixed 3.3 V), PS/SYNC high = forced PWM (low ripple at the radio)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
